    "readme_snippet": "# \ud83c\udf99\ufe0f ScamVoice\n\n> An AI-powered voice assistant that helps identify potential scam calls in real time and empowers users to make safer decisions.\n## \ud83c\udf0d Overview\n\nScamVoice was built during the **Google Hackathon** with one simple goal:\n\n> **Protect people from voice-based scams before they become victims.**\n\nPhone scams have become increasingly sophisticated. Fraudsters impersonate banks, government agencies, customer support, and even family members using AI-generated voices. ScamVoice acts as an intelligent layer of defense by analyzing conversations, identifying suspicious patterns, and providing real-time assistance to users.\n\nInstead of reacting after a scam occurs, ScamVoice focuses on **prevention**.\n\n---\n\n## \u2728 Features\n\n- \ud83c\udfa4 Real-time voice interaction\n- \ud83e\udd16 AI-powered scam detection\n- \u26a0\ufe0f Instant risk alerts\n- \ud83e\udde0 Context-aware conversation analysis\n- \ud83d\udcca Scam confidence scoring\n- \ud83d\udd12 Privacy-first approach\n- \ud83d\udcf1 Clean and user-friendly interface\n\n---\n\n## \ud83d\udee0\ufe0f How It Works\n\n```text\nIncoming Voice\n      \u2502\n      \u25bc\n Speech-to-Text\n      \u2502\n      \u25bc\n AI Analysis Engine\n      \u2502\n      \u251c\u2500\u2500 Detects suspicious language\n      \u251c\u2500\u2500 Recognizes scam patterns\n      \u251c\u2500\u2500 Evaluates conversation context\n    "
  },
